	"data": "The Question of Giah\n\nStage 6 — Seye and Aki, moving deeper, encountering the thing that can't be amplified because it's already at maximum\n\nThey left the workshop together.\n\nThis was not agreement. This was physics. The fog had rearranged the corridors so that the only direction was forward, and forward was the direction they were both facing, and standing still had become the kind of silence that amplifies itself. The fog was doing that now — amplifying the silence between them, filling it…",
